This game is quite good, and certainly not so bad as the Critic says.
The best things are:
- very good animations and combat skills;
- wonderful environments;
- Ayumi, a beautiful, sexy and quite crazy girl;
- Boss fights and bestiary.
The bad things are:
- plot: quite banal;
- the DLC "Dismal Swamp": really awful, from the start to the ending: it is repetitive and boring, oppositely to the base game;
- the Rewind Time Power, that you have to overuse because many enemies and Bosses are simply impossible without it. The basic idea of manipulate time was good, but I had prefered it was not so necessary as it is.
However, I spent funny hours with this game and I surely will finish it again in future.
For me, it deserves a 7,2/10.

